    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh i know but the er is like $2000 just for a visit and i know how these kidney stones feel... i had them last year and it was exactly like this. the pulsing is probably just my heart beating harder because of the pain? can i just take some extra ibuprofen and try to sleep it off for a few hours to see if it passes?",
